---
import proyList from '../../data/proy.json';
import skillsList from '../../data/skills.json';
import certList from '../../data/certif.json';

const featuredProject = proyList[0];
---

<article class="profile-container">
    <!-- 1. HERO SECTION -->
    <section id="h_pf_about-me" class="profile__section">
        <div class="hero glass-panel">
            <div class="hero__avatar-container">
                <div class="hero__avatar-glow"></div>
                <img class="hero__avatar" src="/profile.jpg" alt="Stive Lamatta" />
            </div>

            <div class="hero__content">
                <div class="hero__badge">
                    <span class="pulse-dot"></span> Estudiante de Matemáticas & Desarrollador
                </div>
                <h1 class="hero__name">Stive Lamatta</h1>
                <p class="hero__subtitle">
                    Apasionado por la intersección entre las <strong>matemáticas puras</strong>, los <strong>algoritmos</strong> y la <strong>computación visual</strong>. Aspirante a Data Science.
                </p>

                <div class="hero__actions">
                    <a class="btn-primary" href="#h_pf_projects">
                        <span>Ver Proyecto Estrella</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i>
                    </a>
                    <a class="btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/stivesci" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i>
                        <span>GitHub</span>
                    </a>
                    <a class="btn-secondary" href="https://linkedin.com/in/stivelamatta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i>
                        <span>LinkedIn</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. ABOUT ME HONESTO -->
        <div class="about-card glass-panel">
            <div class="about-card__header">
                <span class="section-icon">📐</span>
                <h2>Sobre Mí & Enfoque</h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                Actualmente soy estudiante universitario de <strong>Matemáticas</strong>. Me fascina descubrir cómo conceptos teóricos abstractos —como el análisis armónico, las series de Fourier, el álgebra lineal o el cálculo diferencial— cobran vida al traducirlos en código y simulaciones interactivas.
            </p>
            <p>
                No me considero un "senior" que domina todo, sino un <strong>estudiante curioso y perseverante</strong> con sólida base lógica y matemática, que disfruta programar, resolver problemas difíciles y aprender continuamente nuevas herramientas del ecosistema de datos y desarrollo web.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. PROYECTO ESTRELLA: EPICICLOS -->
    <section id="h_pf_projects" class="profile__section">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="section-tag">PROYECTO DESTACADO</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Epiciclos — Visualizador de Series de Fourier</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Mi proyecto principal: cómo transformar dibujos y trazos en órbitas de vectores rotatorios complejos calculados matemáticamente.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="featured-project-card glass-panel">
            <div class="project-visual">
                <img src={featuredProject.image} alt={featuredProject.title} class="project-img" loading="lazy" />
                <div class="project-visual__overlay">
                    <a href={featuredProject.enlace} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-live">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Probar en Vivo (epy.stivesci.com)
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="project-details">
                <div class="project-tags">
                    <span class="tag tag-math">Series de Fourier</span>
                    <span class="tag tag-tech">React 19</span>
                    <span class="tag tag-tech">Canvas 60fps</span>
                    <span class="tag tag-tech">Supabase</span>
                </div>

                <h3>{featuredProject.title}</h3>
                <p class="project-description">
                    {featuredProject.description}
                </p>

                <div class="project-math-box">
                    <h4><i class="fa-solid fa-square-root-variable"></i> Matemáticas & Algoritmos Implementados:</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Transformada Discreta de Fourier (DFT):</strong> Descomposición de la trayectoria en coeficientes armónicos complejos: <em>X_k = &sum; x_n &middot; e^(-i 2&pi; k n / N)</em>.</li>
                        <li><strong>Interpolación Spline Catmull-Rom:</strong> Suavizado continuo de puntos para curvas sin quiebres.</li>
                        <li><strong>Cálculo de Baricentro:</strong> Determinación geométrica del centro óptimo de rotación orbital.</li>
                        <li><strong>Renderizado de Video:</strong> Captura de canvas a 60fps con exportación en MP4 y WebM.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="project-actions">
                    <a href={featuredProject.enlace} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i> Abrir Aplicación
                    </a>
                    {
                        featuredProject.github && (
                            <a href={featuredProject.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary">
                                <i class="fa-brands fa-github" /> Código en GitHub
                            </a>
                        )
                    }
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. HABILIDADES Y CONOCIMIENTOS -->
    <section id="h_pf_skills" class="profile__section">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="section-tag">COMPETENCIAS</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Matemáticas, Lenguajes & Herramientas</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Una clasificación honesta de mi formación teórica y las tecnologías con las que trabajo.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skills-categories-grid">
            {
                skillsList.map((cat) => (
                    <div class="skill-category-card glass-panel">
                        <div class="skill-category-header">
                            <span class="category-badge">{cat.badge}</span>
                            <h3>{cat.categoria}</h3>
                            <p class="category-desc">{cat.description}</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="skill-items-grid">
                            {cat.techs.map((t) => (
                                <div class="skill-pill">
                                    {t.isTheoretical ? <span class="math-pill-icon">{t.icon}</span> : <img src={t.image} alt={t.tech} loading="lazy" />}
                                    <span>{t.tech}</span>
                                </div>
                            ))}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                ))
            }
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. CERTIFICACIONES -->
    <section id="h_pf_certifications" class="profile__section">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="section-tag">FORMACIÓN CONTINUA</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Certificados & Cursos Aprobados</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Diplomas obtenidos en áreas de matemáticas avanzadas, cálculo y estadística. Haz clic en cualquiera para ampliar.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="certifications-grid">
            {
                certList.map((c) => (
                    <div class="cert-card glass-panel" data-img={c.image} data-title={c.title}>
                        <div class="cert-img-container">
                            <img src={c.image} alt={c.title} loading="lazy" />
                            <div class="cert-overlay">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-plus" />
                                <span>Ver Diploma</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="cert-info">
                            <h4>{c.title}</h4>
                            <p>{c.institution}</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                ))
            }
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. PRÓXIMAMENTE: BLOG -->
    <section id="h_pf_blog" class="profile__section">
        <div class="blog-teaser-card glass-panel">
            <div class="teaser-icon">✍️</div>
            <div class="teaser-content">
                <span class="category-badge">EN DESARROLLO</span>
                <h3>Blog de Matemáticas & Programación</h3>
                <p>
                    Próximamente escribiré artículos explicando de manera intuitiva temas como <strong>Series de Fourier aplicadas</strong>, <strong>álgebra lineal computacional</strong>, algoritmos geométricos y proyectos de código.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 7. CONTACTO -->
    <section id="h_pf_contact" class="profile__section">
        <div class="contact-card glass-panel">
            <h2>¿Conversamos sobre algún proyecto o problema matemático?</h2>
            <p>Estoy abierto a oportunidades de pasantías, proyectos colaborativos, contribuciones de código abierto o resolver retos técnicos.</p>
            <div class="contact-links">
                <a href="mailto:stive@stivesci.com" class="btn-primary btn-large">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> stive@stivesci.com
                </a>
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/stivelamatta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary btn-large">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i> LinkedIn
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/stivesci" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary btn-large">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i> GitHub
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</article>

<!-- Modal Lightbox para Certificados -->
<div id="cert-lightbox" class="lightbox-modal">
    <div class="lightbox-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="lightbox-content">
        <button id="lightbox-close" class="lightbox-close-btn" aria-label="Cerrar"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
        <img id="lightbox-img" src="" alt="Certificado" />
        <h4 id="lightbox-caption"></h4>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .profile-container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1040px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 5rem;
        padding: 2rem 1.2rem 6rem;
    }

    .profile__section {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.8rem;
    }

    /* Glass Panels */
    .glass-panel {
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
        padding: 2.5rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2.5rem;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero__avatar-container {
        position: relative;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .hero__avatar-glow {
        position: absolute;
        inset: -6px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #10b981);
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(12px);
        opacity: 0.6;
        animation: pulse-glow 3s infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes pulse-glow {
        0% {
            opacity: 0.4;
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }
        100% {
            opacity: 0.75;
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }
    }

    .hero__avatar {
        position: relative;
        width: 130px;
        height: 130px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
        border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .hero__content {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.8rem;
    }

    .hero__badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
        color: #93c5fd;
        border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        width: fit-content;
    }

    .pulse-dot {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        background-color: #34d399;
        border-radius: 50%;
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px #34d399;
    }

    .hero__name {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 2.4rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 40%, #94a3b8);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero__subtitle {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: #cbd5e1;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .hero__actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        margin-top: 0.6rem;
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn-primary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1d4ed8);
        color: #fff;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.5);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        color: #e2e8f0;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.7rem 1.2rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: #fff;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-large {
        padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* About Card */
    .about-card {
        padding: 2rem 2.2rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .about-card__header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .section-icon {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
    }

    .about-card h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .about-card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .about-card strong {
        color: #f1f5f9;
    }

    /* Section Headings */
    .section-heading {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 650px;
        margin: 0 auto 0.5rem;
    }

    .section-tag {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        color: #38bdf8;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .section-title {
        margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .section-subtitle {
        margin: 0;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Featured Project (Epiciclos) */
    .featured-project-card {
        padding: 2.2rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
        gap: 2.5rem;
        align-items: center;
        border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    }

    .project-visual {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 14px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        background: #0f172a;
    }

    .project-img {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
        transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .project-visual:hover .project-img {
        transform: scale(1.03);
    }

    .project-visual__overlay {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.6);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }

    .project-visual:hover .project-visual__overlay {
        opacity: 1;
    }

    .btn-live {
        background: #2563eb;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .project-details {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .project-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .tag {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .tag-math {
        background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
        color: #34d399;
        border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    }

    .tag-tech {
        background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
        color: #93c5fd;
        border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    }

    .project-details h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .project-description {
        margin: 0;
        color: #cbd5e1;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .project-math-box {
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    }

    .project-math-box h4 {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #38bdf8;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
    }

    .project-math-box ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 1.2rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .project-math-box strong {
        color: #e2e8f0;
    }

    .project-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
    }

    /* Skills Categories */
    .skills-categories-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .skill-category-card {
        padding: 1.8rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.2rem;
    }

    .category-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        color: #38bdf8;
        background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
        padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .skill-category-header h3 {
        margin: 0 0 0.3rem 0;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .category-desc {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .skill-items-grid {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .skill-pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #e2e8f0;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .skill-pill:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .skill-pill img {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        object-fit: contain;
    }

    .math-pill-icon {
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #34d399;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* Certifications Grid */
    .certifications-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .cert-card {
        padding: 1rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition:
            transform 0.2s ease,
            border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .cert-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
    }

    .cert-img-container {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
        background: #0f172a;
    }

    .cert-img-container img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
    }

    .cert-overlay {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 6px;
        color: #fff;
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .cert-card:hover .cert-overlay {
        opacity: 1;
    }

    .cert-info h4 {
        margin: 0 0 0.2rem 0;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .cert-info p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
    }

    /* Blog Teaser */
    .blog-teaser-card {
        padding: 2.2rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1.8rem;
        border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }

    .teaser-icon {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 1rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .teaser-content h3 {
        margin: 0.3rem 0 0.5rem 0;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .teaser-content p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Contact Card */
    .contact-card {
        padding: 3rem 2rem;
        text-align: center;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1.2rem;
    }

    .contact-card h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #f8fafc;
        max-width: 600px;
    }

    .contact-card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 1rem;
        max-width: 550px;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .contact-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
    }

    /* Lightbox Modal */
    .lightbox-modal {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 200;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .lightbox-modal.active {
        display: flex;
    }

    .lightbox-backdrop {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    .lightbox-content {
        position: relative;
        max-width: 850px;
        max-height: 90vh;
        background: #1e293b;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        z-index: 10;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    }

    .lightbox-content img {
        max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 70vh;
        border-radius: 8px;
        object-fit: contain;
    }

    .lightbox-close-btn {
        position: absolute;
        top: 12px;
        right: 12px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        border: none;
        color: #fff;
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        font-size: 18px;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .lightbox-close-btn:hover {
        background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.8);
    }

    #lightbox-caption {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #e2e8f0;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: center;
    }

    /* Mobile Responsiveness */
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
        .hero {
            flex-direction: column;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero__badge {
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero__actions {
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .featured-project-card {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .blog-teaser-card {
            flex-direction: column;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.8rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
    }
</style>

<script>
    // Lightbox for certificates
    const certCards = document.querySelectorAll('.cert-card');
    const lightbox = document.getElementById('cert-lightbox');
    const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightbox-img') as HTMLImageElement;
    const lightboxCaption = document.getElementById('lightbox-caption');
    const lightboxClose = document.getElementById('lightbox-close');
    const backdrop = document.querySelector('.lightbox-backdrop');

    if (certCards && lightbox && lightboxImg) {
        certCards.forEach((card) => {
            card.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const imgUrl = card.getAttribute('data-img');
                const title = card.getAttribute('data-title');
                if (imgUrl) lightboxImg.src = imgUrl;
                if (title && lightboxCaption) lightboxCaption.textContent = title;
                lightbox.classList.add('active');
                document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
            });
        });

        const closeLightbox = () => {
            lightbox.classList.remove('active');
            document.body.style.overflow = '';
        };

        if (lightboxClose) lightboxClose.addEventListener('click', closeLightbox);
        if (backdrop) backdrop.addEventListener('click', closeLightbox);

        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            if (e.key === 'Escape' && lightbox.classList.contains('active')) {
                closeLightbox();
            }
        });
    }
</script>
